{"title": "Concerning the Future of Baldur's Gate", "pageid": 46725, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Concerning_the_Future_of_Baldur's_Gate", "categories": ["Notes", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Note_C_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Book_Note_C_Image.png/300px-Book_Note_C_Image.png.webp, /w/images/9/9e/Book_Note_C_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Concerning the Future of Baldur's Gate image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Book_Note_C_Image.png/300px-Book_Note_C_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9e/Book_Note_C_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Concerning the Future of Baldur's Gate</b> is an invitation to discuss serious matters.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A plain, unadorned note.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/25px-Notes_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/38px-Notes_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/50px-Notes_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Notes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/25px-Notes_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\">Notes</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Author:  Society of Brilliance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Author: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Society_of_Brilliance\" title=\"Society of Brilliance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Society_of_Brilliance.png/27px-Portrait_Society_of_Brilliance.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Society_of_Brilliance.png/40px-Portrait_Society_of_Brilliance.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Society_of_Brilliance.png/53px-Portrait_Society_of_Brilliance.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Society of Brilliance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Society_of_Brilliance.png/27px-Portrait_Society_of_Brilliance.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Portrait_Society_of_Brilliance.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Society_of_Brilliance\" title=\"Society of Brilliance\">Society of Brilliance</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: .05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: .05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the mailbox of <a href=\"/wiki/Golbraith%27s_Cellar\" title=\"Golbraith's Cellar\">Golbraith's Home</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-151&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-55</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Dear Master <a href=\"/wiki/Golbraith_Stredivas\" title=\"Golbraith Stredivas\">Golbraith</a>,\n</p><p><br>\nWord has been brought to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Candlekeep\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/33px-BGWiki.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/44px-BGWiki.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Candlekeep\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/BGWiki.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Candlekeep\">Candlekeep</a></span> that <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a> is under threat and there are those who claim that the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_flayer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind flayer\">mind flayer</a> plot is being driven from within the city's own seats of power. As a leading expert in mind flayers and counter-illithid strategies, we would like to consult with you that we may pool our resources to destroy such a plot before it takes root. Leave word for us at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Lodge\" title=\"The Lodge\">The Lodge</a>, and we will arrange a date and time.  -- The First Reader.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The First Reader is the person in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Candlekeep\">Candlekeep</a> responsible for improving the library-fortress' vast collection of knowledge.</li>\n<li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Letter_of_Thanks\" title=\"Letter of Thanks\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Letter_of_Thanks\" title=\"Letter of Thanks\">Letter of Thanks</a></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202405\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1911/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27146/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9401/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 929816/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.985      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   41.985      1 -total\n 35.01%   14.697      7 Template:Icon_text\n 30.06%   12.619     21 Template:Trim\n 18.59%    7.807      3 Template:Icon_link\n 17.92%    7.524      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 16.34%    6.862      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.66%    5.736      1 Template:Item_icon\n 13.66%    5.734      9 Template:Ifempty\n 12.00%    5.038      1 Template:Notes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:46725-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202405 and revision id 394580. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}